<title>HONG KONG: HK's outward processing trade to China in Q3.</title>
<headline>HK's outward processing trade to China in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Census and Statistics Department issued the following data on Wednesday on the estimated value of the territory's outward processing trade with China in the third quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>(Rounded figures in billions of Hong Kong dollars and year-on-year percentage change in brackets):</p>
<p>				     Q3 1996	     Q2 1996</p>
<p>Total exports to China     62.12 (+10.6)     58.20 (+ 1.9)</p>
<p>Domestic exports to China  11.53 (- 5.8)     10.85 (- 5.6)</p>
<p>Re-exports to China	  50.59 (+15.2)     47.35 (+</p>
<p>3.7)</p>
<p>Imports from China 126.75 (+11.4) 111.52 (+15.2)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
